# This file is part of OffgridDev
# models.env
# Author(s): Gabriel Mongefranco
# Created: 2026-04-23
# Last Modified: 2026-08-06
# Summary: Enables/disables which Ollama models the startup scripts pull, ordered low to
#   high VRAM. Each flag is read directly by scripts/offgriddev-start.ps1 and .sh, which
#   also block startup if an enabled model exceeds the detected GPU's VRAM.
# Notes: See README file for documentation and full license information.
#
